## 20. Admin Hub + Navigation (2026-08-31)

**Scope:** аудит (read-only) + **Iteration 1** (shell fix). Graphify: `graphify-out/` (2026-08-31 post-§24: **917 nodes**, 938 edges, 110 communities); update: `graphify update .` (global CLI, не `npx`).

### Current architecture (post Iteration 1)

```
ProtectedRoute
└── AppLayout (SidebarNav, MobileHeader, BottomNav, offline)
    ├── /home              → HomePage (admin = teacher UI, §112)
    ├── /lessons, /chat, /events, /profile, /notifications …
    └── AdminRoute (can(user, permission))
        ├── /admin         → AdminHubPage
        ├── /admin/schedule → AdminSchedulePage
        └── /admin/users   → AdminUsersPage
```

- `/home` (admin) = **teacher Home** (свои занятия), не KPI-обзор (§112).
